{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an administrator\u2019s memorandum salvaged from deep in the mountains.<br>Some things you don't need to understand\u2014just follow the instructions, and you may survive this mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misty Onsen</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set at a remote hot\u2011spring facility in the Japanese mountains.<br>Inspired by a widely circulated rumor\u2011style memorandum online, said to be connected to a mysterious disappearance.<br>You take on the job, conduct daily patrols\u2014and gradually realize: this mountain conceals something unspeakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd3 <strong>Memorandum: Work Rules (must follow)</strong><br>\u30fbWear highly visible clothing<br>\u30fbNever stray from the designated route<br>\u30fbIf you hear someone calling, do not look back or respond<br>\u30fbIf you see a woman, remember\u2014<strong>there shouldn\u2019t be any on this mountain</strong><br>\u30fbIf you detect any strange odor, evacuate immediately</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Features</strong><br>\u30fbPsychological horror driven by atmosphere: fear arises from isolation, ambience, and the unknown<br>\u30fbInspired by mysterious online rumors: grounded in realistic work settings and mountain\u2011forest taboos<br>\u30fbOccasional sudden events: not centered on jump scares, but danger can appear unexpectedly<br>\u30fbNo combat\u2014only decisions and escape: surviving by the rules is your only goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0 <strong>Warning</strong><br>If you hear someone calling your name, <strong>no one will be there</strong>.<br>Do not answer, do not turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept this job, and you will discover\u2014this mountain hides something unspeakable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798310?t=1756619154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798310/c1d2abc431385e282224102b1fa9a77b29c6c5cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756619154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798310/4cb05d1476e374e9e4ea83afaeea7c4e3fccbf15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756619154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798310/4cb05d1476e374e9e4ea83afaeea7c4e3fccbf15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756619154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains intense psychological horror elements, including frightening ghost appearances and disturbing narrative themes. Some content may be unsettling to sensitive players. There is no sexual content, non-consensual acts, or depictions of drug or alcohol use.\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an administrator\u2019s memorandum salvaged from deep in the mountains.<br>Some things you don't need to understand\u2014just follow the instructions, and you may survive this mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misty Onsen</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set at a remote hot\u2011spring facility in the Japanese mountains.<br>Inspired by a widely circulated rumor\u2011style memorandum online, said to be connected to a mysterious disappearance.<br>You take on the job, conduct daily patrols\u2014and gradually realize: this mountain conceals something unspeakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd3 <strong>Memorandum: Work Rules (must follow)</strong><br>\u30fbWear highly visible clothing<br>\u30fbNever stray from the designated route<br>\u30fbIf you hear someone calling, do not look back or respond<br>\u30fbIf you see a woman, remember\u2014<strong>there shouldn\u2019t be any on this mountain</strong><br>\u30fbIf you detect any strange odor, evacuate immediately</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Features</strong><br>\u30fbPsychological horror driven by atmosphere: fear arises from isolation, ambience, and the unknown<br>\u30fbInspired by mysterious online rumors: grounded in realistic work settings and mountain\u2011forest taboos<br>\u30fbOccasional sudden events: not centered on jump scares, but danger can appear unexpectedly<br>\u30fbNo combat\u2014only decisions and escape: surviving by the rules is your only goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0 <strong>Warning</strong><br>If you hear someone calling your name, <strong>no one will be there</strong>.<br>Do not answer, do not turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept this job, and you will discover\u2014this mountain hides something unspeakable.</p>","developers":["SHEN Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798310/6a0870e3cbea8eb8afb0e812b0502f4ffcd508e6/header.jpg?t=1756619154","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188377,"mp4":{"480":